### Step 1 — clean state
POST https://localhost:7100/api/testing/reset

### Step 2 — inject a deposit that will need review (IBAN mismatch)
POST https://localhost:7100/api/testing/inject-deposit-for-review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "counterpartyIban": "DE99999999999999999999",
  "counterpartyName": "Mystery Sender",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "reason": 1
}

###

